        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-05T13:52:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would think by far the most important question to ask first here is <em>why</em> do you want it to be set in the real Tomb?</p><p>In order to offer any advice on how to best progress with the story altered like that, I feel I'd first need to know why you feel it's necessary to do so in the first place?</p>",
