        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Melkhor\"]\n\nI would think by far the most important question to ask first here is <em>why</em> do you want it to be set in the real Tomb?In order to offer any advice on how to best progress with the story altered like that, I feel I&#39;d first need to know why you feel it&#39;s necessary to do so in the first place?\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nWell, my players are newcomers to the setting and showed interest in it&#39;s take on Egypcian mythos. When it came to choose between issues 3-4-5, they seemed excited at the idea of exploring a Egypcian tomb full of mummies, traps and all those classic tidbits. I feel like making it all a scooby-doo-like hoax would take most of the fun while the twist doesn&#39;t seem worth it.&nbsp;\n\nSo I&#39;m trying to find a way to tie this adventure to the plot, while also letting players fight actual mummies and traps.&nbsp;\n",
