        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-05T22:13:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Also, since you won't be using the skeletrons, another minor change might be in order for the final issue and the big showdown. Perhaps, instead of having Blade bring back the robot skeletons there, have him siphon off some of Anubis' power while he's using him as a battery, and use that stolen energy to empower and/or enhance some other kind of suitably thematic minion (or even himself, for that matter) for the final fight in Issue 6. Just a thought :)</p>",
